### VS Code ###
.vscode/
/src/main/resources/application-local.properties
/src/main/resources/application-remote.properties
/src/main/resources/cert/
# The development certificate set (scripts/generate_dev_certs.sh) is committed: the mtls profile
# references it as classpath:, so it has to be on the classpath on every machine. Without these
# two lines a regenerated set is silently untracked and only the machine that ran the script can
# talk to OBP-API over mTLS.
!/src/main/resources/cert/
!/src/main/resources/cert/**

### Local development (never commit)
# Personal per-machine overrides for the dev profile: ports, URLs, client secrets.
src/main/resources/application-local.properties
# OBP consumer registration output -- contains Consumer Key/Secret pairs.
consumer.txt
